%I A399209 #11 Sep 02 2026 18:03:01
%S A399209 1,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,260,11308,669668,64662438,10878522046
%N A399209 Number of nonisomorphic connected Eulerian simple graphs on n vertices with trivial automorphism group.
%C A399209 Equivalently, a(n) counts connected unlabeled simple graphs on n vertices in which every vertex has even degree and the automorphism group is trivial.
%H A399209 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A399209/a399209_1.pdf">Asymmetric Connected Eulerian Graphs</a>
%H A399209 F. Szöllősi and P. R. J. Östergård, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejc.2017.10.009">Enumeration of Seidel matrices</a>, European J. Combin. 69 (2018), 169-184.
%F A399209 Let b(n) be the number of nonisomorphic (not necessarily connected) Eulerian simple graphs on n vertices with trivial automorphism group. Then Sum_{n>=0} b(n)*x^n = Product_{m>=1} (1+x^m)^a(m).
%e A399209 a(8) = 4: there are exactly four nonisomorphic connected Eulerian simple graphs on 8 vertices with trivial automorphism group.
%Y A399209 Cf. A003049 (connected Eulerian graphs), A002854 (Euler graphs), A003400 (asymmetric simple graphs).
%K A399209 nonn,more,new
%O A399209 1,8
%A A399209 _Vladeta Jovovic_, Aug 22 2026
